cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use BNI3, please cite it as below."
title: "BNI3: three-stage Boolean network inference from sparse transcriptomic time series"
abstract: >-
  BNI3 infers Boolean gene regulatory networks from sparse transcriptomic time
  series in three stages: binarization of expression, rule inference and
  evaluation, and attractor analysis with in-silico perturbations.
type: software
